### 7.5 Outside the window core banking still answers EOD_IN_PROGRESS for this marker; Accounts trusts the refusal and
#     asks again every minute. Inside the window (22:00-06:00 market time) no call is made until 06:00.
### 7.5 EOD_IN_PROGRESS: deferred
